{"id":"na9e714c4f4","headline":"IRDAI weighs January 2027 rollout of insurance commission caps amid selloff in insurance linked stocks: Report - BusinessToday","summary":"India's IRDAI is weighing a January 2027 rollout of commission caps on insurers, after proposing limits on payments to brokers and distributors. Insurance-linked stocks have sold off, and tighter limits on management expenses are planned over time.","why":"The Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India regulates the country's insurers. Commission caps change distribution economics and profitability for listed insurers and brokers.","category":"companies","event_type":"regulation","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Hyderabad","country":"India","lat":17.385,"lon":78.487,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/corporate/story/irdai-weighs-january-2027-rollout-of-insurance-commission-caps-amid-selloff-in-insurance-linked-stocks-report-560712-2026-10-09"},"sources":[{"name":"Business Today","url":"https://www.businesstoday.in/latest/corporate/story/irdai-weighs-january-2027-rollout-of-insurance-commission-caps-amid-selloff-in-insurance-linked-stocks-report-560712-2026-10-09"}],"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:42:41Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"7a0564c602e49b27","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-09T11:42:41Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-09T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-5147228.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"AJS1","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay